RAWYANG [address]
  YANG for raw pages: the server lays the page out for the screen
  (the address gets &8bml=7&raw=<width>) - its rows, links and
  form fields ready to show, no 8BML read here: quicker, and smaller.
  On the whole screen (RAWYING: in a window).
  address: http://host[:port]/path?parameters (the network first:
  NET M4), or a raw file - A:NAME.RAW, NAME.RAW. None: HOME.RAW (this
  drive, else A:, else Z:). A tab: RAWYANG in another slot.
  Keys and forms: as YANG's (HELP YANG).
  A server makes raw pages as tools/rawpage/8bml2raw.py does (RAW.TXT:
  the format).
